    description: "WHAT. PR #2198 left every path with one file pseudo-symbol. Where two producers had minted one, the survivor is the file's own language. Where ONLY the JavaScript analyzer minted one (a component with a script and no template edges), the node stays typescript:X.vue / javascript:X.svelte: re-slotting it changes make_file_stable_id's input, a stable-id move.\n\nMEASURED. koel 62 of 297 components, workadventure play/src/front 187 of 440. If members are re-anchored on the new file id too, up to 1,925 (koel) and 3,844 (workadventure) member ids move.\n\nFOR THE BUMP, to check first: whether the containment linker roots typescript members under a svelte: file node; that the placeholder demotion (ADR-0057 section 14.1) survives once both producers mint one id. Blade paths keep php: because taxonomy.get_language reads the last suffix only (.blade.php -> blade is unreachable in _EXTENSION_MAP). Found during PR 1 of the stable-id plan, 2026-11-15 (PR #2198). Detail: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/pr1/STATUS.md."  # 5ac0
    fields: {}  # 5ac0
