  message: "Ruled by the owner 2026-11-23 (\"re-anchor.\") and built in PR #2354 (dev 39bef1108): a Vue or Svelte component's file node is in its own language slot whether or not a template edge names it, and the script's functions, methods and fields fold that node's stable id.\nFILED REPRO RE-RUN on dev 39bef1108 (the fixture of the 2026-11-20 note: Only.svelte with a script only, Only.vue with script setup lang=ts only): file nodes svelte:Only.svelte:1-1:file:file and vue:Only.vue:1-1:file:file; on dev 05ed6f5fe javascript:Only.svelte and typescript:Only.vue. The members greet and hi moved. koel on 39bef1108: 297 component file nodes, 297 in the vue: slot.\nMEASURED by the builder: koel 62 file nodes and 1,283 member ids moved, workadventure play/src/front 187 and 1,660. The item's two \"to check first\" points: the containment linker roots the members under the component's file node (the fixture's map on 39bef1108 has contains edges svelte:Only.svelte file to greet and to name, vue:Only.vue file to hi and to n); the ADR-0057 14.1 placeholder demotion survives (file_records.py carries the provenance).\nNOT MOVED: script variables, interfaces, types and enums never folded a file id and keep theirs: WI-siror-bupaz-zofiz-jomam-jimim-komoh-vavad-sirar. NOT FIXED, filed: taxonomy has no .astro, Blade paths keep php:, a dead variable in the Vue linker: WI-luroj-moviz-matob-makur-fidup-gafud-savoj-jikas (Blade, the dead variable); a note on WI-futin (.astro).\nEvidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/closure/ (out_dev.txt = dev 39bef1108 after the merge, out_base.txt = dev 05ed6f5fe before it; repro trees t/, run.sh, q.py, presplit.py)."  # e037
